  "description": "Annie is a lonely girl who is afraid of mirrors, while Liam is a well-known model and actor. It may seem unlikely that two people with such different lives could relate to each other, but sometimes, people's external appearance doesn't reflect their true souls. This is the story of two broken hearts and their journey toward self-acceptance and love. \n\n(Source: Webtoon)",
